      "en": "They went and came to Moses, to Aaron, and to all the congregation of the children of Israel, to the wilderness of Paran, to Kadesh; and brought back word to them and to all the congregation. They showed them the fruit of the land.",
      "ko": "바란 광야 가데스에 이르러 모세와 아론과 이스라엘 자손의 온 회중에게 나아와 그들에게 회보하고 그 땅 실과를 보이고",
      "source_text_hash": "9b34191068660095666555757d6bb2e2c4b28ae863d99e221080dc28fa97bdc5",
      "translation_text_hash": "fa456ce0e2039076c3cccc2da25e40d6a0ef6ddd68558d3fdf53c33a8c2d83be",
